  <sector code="15180" percentage="100" vocabulary="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching aim of this project is to promote women&#x2019;s leadership in protection and peace building to reduce the prevalence and impact of conflict and violence, especially SGBV, on communities in South Sudan. The 4 objectives are: 

1) Direct protection, prevention and response 
2) Positive messaging and awareness raising 
3) Capacity development and community-based protection 
 4) Coordination and advocacy</narrative>
  </sector>
